  "description": {
   "en": "Meat has been the trainer of the great Choujin superhero Kinnikuman for long. He thought his job was done helping his greatest subject become a master Choujin and king of his homeworld. But…what if upon waiting for his next subject, the little trainer was sent to another world?…  \n  \nA world where Kinnikuman has yet to become a great hero… and a world where he is… female!?  \n  \nWelcome to the world of Kinnikuman Lady! A world that promises to be as bizarre and exciting as the one of the original Kinnikuman."
  },
