   "attributes": {
    "biography": {
     "en": "Yudetamago (lit. \"boiled egg\" in Japanese) is the pen name of a mangaka duo consisting of author **Takashi Shimada** and artist **Yoshinori Nakai**. After becoming close friends in elementary school, the two started to get into the world of manga, starting with their most popular work Kinnikuman."
